Come on, Junnan.

581
00:26:02,750 --> 00:26:03,880
What can I do?

582
00:26:04,590 --> 00:26:06,270
Don't be modest.

583
00:26:06,480 --> 00:26:07,270
When we went to Beijing,

584
00:26:07,270 --> 00:26:09,470
look how well you arranged everything.

585
00:26:09,550 --> 00:26:11,030
Nowadays, finding

586
00:26:11,030 --> 00:26:12,590
a trustworthy person to cooperate with

587
00:26:12,590 --> 00:26:14,400
is really not easy.

588
00:26:17,310 --> 00:26:17,960
Forget it.

589
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:18,830
I'd better

590
00:26:18,830 --> 00:26:20,090
stay in the Northeast.

591
00:26:20,110 --> 00:26:21,310
Quit running around.

592
00:26:25,030 --> 00:26:25,830
Zhengliang,

593
00:26:26,640 --> 00:26:28,640
give your little brother some advice.

594
00:26:28,640 --> 00:26:30,440
Why are you asking him about my business?

595
00:26:30,440 --> 00:26:31,310
Isn't he your brother?

596
00:26:31,310 --> 00:26:32,350
Brothers should discuss things

597
00:26:32,350 --> 00:26:33,960
with each other.

598
00:26:35,030 --> 00:26:37,030
Zhengliang, what's your advice?

599
00:26:37,750 --> 00:26:38,680
He has no advice.

600
00:26:41,110 --> 00:26:42,040
Liu Zhengliang.

601
00:26:43,400 --> 00:26:45,200
G-Give Zhengguang some advice.

602
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:48,830
Do you still remember Wang Bao?

603
00:26:48,830 --> 00:26:49,550
Who?

604
00:26:53,510 --> 00:26:55,270
The coward is having a seizure!

605
00:26:55,590 --> 00:26:56,520
Liu Zhengliang!

606
00:26:57,680 --> 00:26:59,010
What are you guys doing?

607
00:27:01,590 --> 00:27:02,880
Chen Junnan is here! Run!

608
00:27:02,880 --> 00:27:04,200
What are you doing?

609
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:06,840
It's okay. It's okay.

610
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:07,980
Safe now. Safe now.

611
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:11,030
I remember now.

612
00:27:12,030 --> 00:27:13,200
The one who bullied you back then,

613
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:13,830
right?

614
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:17,930
Who bullied you?

615
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:19,590
No one bullied me.

616
00:27:19,680 --> 00:27:21,350
Just playing around. Nonsense.

617
00:27:21,350 --> 00:27:22,160
Go back to sleep.

618
00:27:22,160 --> 00:27:23,110
Would he dare?

619
00:27:23,350 --> 00:27:24,480
What is it, Junnan?

620
00:27:25,480 --> 00:27:26,790
About this Wang Bao...

621
00:27:27,070 --> 00:27:28,070
Back then,

622
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:29,640
you were still young.

623
00:27:29,640 --> 00:27:31,040
You don't remember much.

624
00:27:40,180 --> 00:27:46,560
[Emergency]

625
00:28:02,110 --> 00:28:03,310
Chief Physician Liu.

626
00:28:04,590 --> 00:28:06,120
D-Do you still remember me?

627
00:28:07,790 --> 00:28:08,920
Aren't you the patient

628
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:10,520
who came to see me yesterday?

629
00:28:11,590 --> 00:28:13,720
We were classmates in primary school.

630
00:28:13,830 --> 00:28:14,920
When you came in yesterday,

631
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:16,110
you looked familiar.

632
00:28:16,110 --> 00:28:17,510
Later, I went to your department

633
00:28:17,510 --> 00:28:18,830
and checked the expert's resume.

634
00:28:18,830 --> 00:28:20,230
Then I was sure it was you.

635
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:23,310
I have a deep impression of you.

636
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:26,000
And then?

637
00:28:28,000 --> 00:28:29,790
You went to the South later, right?

638
00:28:29,790 --> 00:28:32,110
Yes, I just came back recently.

639
00:28:35,110 --> 00:28:37,160
Well, I've asked around.

640
00:28:37,680 --> 00:28:40,160
You are indeed the most famous expert

641
00:28:40,510 --> 00:28:41,970
in my condition right now.

642
00:28:43,440 --> 00:28:44,310
I want to say...

643
00:28:50,790 --> 00:28:53,720
I am a good teacher now.

644
00:28:55,440 --> 00:28:56,770
I teach very seriously.

645
00:28:57,880 --> 00:28:59,030
My students

646
00:28:59,030 --> 00:29:00,550
also like me very much.

647
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:04,450
Why are you telling me this?

648
00:29:11,640 --> 00:29:12,440
I...

649
00:29:15,310 --> 00:29:16,770
I want to have the surgery.

650
00:29:19,310 --> 00:29:21,570
You will try your best to treat me, right?

651
00:29:21,790 --> 00:29:22,550
Of course.

652
00:29:23,350 --> 00:29:23,960
You are the patient,

653
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:25,020
and I am the doctor.

654
00:29:25,480 --> 00:29:26,590
I will do my best

655
00:29:26,590 --> 00:29:27,650
for every patient.

656
00:29:33,110 --> 00:29:33,960
That's good.

657
00:29:37,270 --> 00:29:38,270
Then... alright,

658
00:29:38,350 --> 00:29:39,310
I don't have anything else.

659
00:29:39,310 --> 00:29:40,640
You can get back to work.

660
00:29:47,530 --> 00:29:51,220
[Emergency]

661
00:29:56,030 --> 00:29:56,680
Dad.

662
00:29:57,110 --> 00:29:58,640
You look so energetic.

663
00:29:58,640 --> 00:29:59,700
It's our birthday.

664
00:29:59,880 --> 00:30:00,720
I have to dress up

665
00:30:00,720 --> 00:30:02,000
neatly.

666
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:04,200
The dishes are almost ready.

667
00:30:04,200 --> 00:30:05,830
Only the longevity noodles are left.

668
00:30:05,830 --> 00:30:06,640
Okay.

669
00:30:14,830 --> 00:30:15,400
Junnan.

670
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:15,880
Uncle Che.

671
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:16,880
Come in, come in.

672
00:30:18,350 --> 00:30:19,030
Happy birthday.

673
00:30:19,030 --> 00:30:20,640
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

674
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:21,700
Where is Mingming?

675
00:30:22,070 --> 00:30:23,400
She's cooking noodles.

676
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:26,860
You even brought gifts. This kid.

677
00:30:27,160 --> 00:30:27,920
Mingming.

678
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:29,930
Happy birthday.

679
00:30:31,110 --> 00:30:31,920
Thank you.

680
00:30:34,030 --> 00:30:35,720
How did you know it's our birthday?

681
00:30:35,720 --> 00:30:36,400
When Uncle Che and I

682
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:37,920
checked in in Beijing,

683
00:30:38,310 --> 00:30:39,680
it was written on the ID card.

684
00:30:39,680 --> 00:30:40,610
I remembered it.

685
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:41,680
Nonsense.

686
00:30:42,240 --> 00:30:43,350
Didn't I tell you that

687
00:30:43,350 --> 00:30:44,680
Mingming and I share the same birthday?

688
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:45,550
You forgot?

689
00:30:47,030 --> 00:30:47,830
Yes.

690
00:30:53,830 --> 00:30:54,640
The key.

691
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:09,070
Junnan.

692
00:31:10,510 --> 00:31:13,270
This key is very good.

693
00:31:14,270 --> 00:31:15,640
He's so thoughtful.

694
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:17,790
With such a good cake,

695
00:31:17,790 --> 00:31:19,440
should we make a wish?

696
00:31:19,480 --> 00:31:20,810
-Make a wish.
-Go ahead.

697
00:31:23,510 --> 00:31:26,160
I hope I, Che Changhai,

698
00:31:27,350 --> 00:31:28,680
my daughter Mingming,

699
00:31:30,510 --> 00:31:32,110
and of course, our Junnan,

700
00:31:32,640 --> 00:31:34,350
will all be healthy

701
00:31:34,880 --> 00:31:36,140
and have a smooth life.

702
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:38,400
Especially Mingming

703
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:40,510
and our Junnan.

704
00:31:41,160 --> 00:31:42,350
Both young.

705
00:31:44,110 --> 00:31:46,510
Be open and bold in what you do.

706
00:31:47,480 --> 00:31:48,810
Whatever comes to mind,

707
00:31:49,880 --> 00:31:50,640
don't hesitate.

708
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:51,550
Just go for it.

709
00:31:51,550 --> 00:31:53,810
-Do it bravely.
-The cake will get soggy.

710
00:31:53,830 --> 00:31:55,890
I haven't finished making my wishes.

711
00:31:56,070 --> 00:31:56,880
Do it bravely.

712
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:58,340
You can achieve anything.

713
00:31:59,750 --> 00:32:00,550
Alright.

714
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:02,810
Did I say it well?

715
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:04,400
May your dreams come true

716
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:06,380
and your wishes be fulfilled.

717
00:32:19,480 --> 00:32:20,270
Are you done?

718
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:22,380
What did you wish for? Tell us.

719
00:32:23,270 --> 00:32:24,440
I hope...

720
00:32:25,070 --> 00:32:27,270
my dad stays healthy.

721
00:32:28,270 --> 00:32:29,110
I hope

722
00:32:29,200 --> 00:32:30,880
my dad and I

723
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:32,330
will have a better life.

724
00:32:32,960 --> 00:32:34,030
I hope

725
00:32:35,030 --> 00:32:36,690
I can get into the PhD program.

726
00:32:38,350 --> 00:32:39,160
That's it?

727
00:32:40,110 --> 00:32:40,960
That's it?

728
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:42,820
That's enough.

729
00:32:43,750 --> 00:32:44,680
Don't you think

730
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:45,550
something is missing?

731
00:32:45,550 --> 00:32:46,750
Blow out the candles.

732
00:32:47,270 --> 00:32:48,070
Okay.

733
00:32:48,750 --> 00:32:49,960
One, two, three.

734
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:53,640
Happy birthday!

735
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:55,880
Thank you. That's very thoughtful.

736
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:57,510
Taking this opportunity

737
00:32:57,510 --> 00:32:58,790
of your birthdays,

738
00:33:00,110 --> 00:33:01,960
c-can I say a few words?

739
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:03,200
Go ahead.

740
00:33:05,830 --> 00:33:06,920
I hope

741
00:33:08,240 --> 00:33:09,720
I can be

742
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:12,880
braver in the future.

743
00:33:14,030 --> 00:33:15,000
Sometimes,

744
00:33:15,680 --> 00:33:18,270
well, I tend to hide.

745
00:33:18,310 --> 00:33:19,480
When I encounter something,

746
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:21,030
thinking about the result

747
00:33:21,030 --> 00:33:22,350
makes me want to give up.

748
00:33:22,350 --> 00:33:23,000
Right.

749
00:33:26,110 --> 00:33:26,960
But

750
00:33:28,110 --> 00:33:29,920
I finally found something

751
00:33:30,400 --> 00:33:32,790
that I can't let go of,

752
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:35,880
no matter how many times I fail.

753
00:33:37,160 --> 00:33:38,310
I mean...

754
00:33:39,960 --> 00:33:41,350
no matter what the future holds,

755
00:33:41,350 --> 00:33:43,070
I will keep going.

756
00:33:43,310 --> 00:33:44,970
Do you understand, Mingming?

757
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:48,000
You're talking about yourself.

758
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,660
What does it have to do with me?

759
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:51,680
Right, I'm talking about myself.

760
00:33:51,680 --> 00:33:53,270
I just want to say

761
00:33:53,270 --> 00:33:53,920
that no matter

762
00:33:53,920 --> 00:33:55,310
what difficulties I encounter,

763
00:33:55,310 --> 00:33:56,310
I won't give up—

764
00:33:56,310 --> 00:33:57,110
Chen Junnan.

765
00:33:57,920 --> 00:33:59,520
Aren't you going to Beijing?

766
00:33:59,880 --> 00:34:01,200
Beijing is quite far.

767
00:34:01,200 --> 00:34:01,720
Don't keep worrying

768
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:02,790
about things here.

769
00:34:03,110 --> 00:34:04,270
Just settle down there

770
00:34:04,270 --> 00:34:05,480
and work hard.

771
00:34:05,640 --> 00:34:07,640
You finally got the chance to go out.

772
00:34:10,190 --> 00:34:12,320
Junnan, you're going to Beijing?

773
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,639
You won't care about me anymore?

774
00:34:16,070 --> 00:34:16,880
I will.

775
00:34:17,760 --> 00:34:18,550
Well...

776
00:34:36,110 --> 00:34:36,880
Are you done?

777
00:34:37,110 --> 00:34:37,960
Almost.

778
00:34:38,230 --> 00:34:40,880
Let me put on the headpiece.

779
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:43,110
Does it hurt?

780
00:34:43,110 --> 00:34:43,840
No.

781
00:34:48,190 --> 00:34:49,110
This one.

782
00:34:49,230 --> 00:34:51,110
Do I look good like this?

783
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:53,760
Very pretty.

784
00:34:54,280 --> 00:34:55,880
Let me tell you,

785
00:34:56,190 --> 00:34:57,070
you are the most beautiful bride

786
00:34:57,070 --> 00:34:58,880
I have ever seen.

787
00:35:03,110 --> 00:35:03,880
Chen.

788
00:35:04,480 --> 00:35:05,960
How are things between you and Dr. Liu?

789
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:07,360
Any plans to get married?

790
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:08,590
Us?

791
00:35:08,590 --> 00:35:09,360
We...

792
00:35:10,840 --> 00:35:12,500
haven't been dating for long.

793
00:35:13,590 --> 00:35:14,520
There's no rush.

794
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:17,600
I haven't even thought about it.

795
00:35:18,110 --> 00:35:19,440
Although I can't see,

796
00:35:19,840 --> 00:35:21,280
my hearing's just fine.

797
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:22,030
Really?

798
00:35:22,190 --> 00:35:24,590
I can tell you've thought about it
just by listening.

799
00:35:24,590 --> 00:35:25,670
Are you that good?

800
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:30,110
Then I'll wait

801
00:35:30,440 --> 00:35:31,960
until this winter is over.

802
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:35,230
Chen.

803
00:35:36,840 --> 00:35:38,550
I went blind in the winter.

804
00:35:40,110 --> 00:35:41,510
But I always believe

805
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:43,400
that I'll definitely see

806
00:35:43,400 --> 00:35:44,460
spring come again.

807
00:35:47,440 --> 00:35:48,480
Spring will come.

808
00:35:49,320 --> 00:35:50,030
Right?

809
00:35:51,670 --> 00:35:52,590
Of course.

810
00:35:54,440 --> 00:35:56,070
Spring will always come.

811
00:36:32,230 --> 00:36:33,320
Are you nervous?

812
00:36:34,070 --> 00:36:34,880
No.

813
00:36:35,710 --> 00:36:37,150
I'm talking to Xiaozhu.

814
00:36:38,400 --> 00:36:39,190
Me?

815
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:40,800
A little.

816
00:36:41,550 --> 00:36:42,360
Isn't this

817
00:36:42,510 --> 00:36:44,710
my first time driving
the wedding lead car?

818
00:36:44,710 --> 00:36:45,920
I'm not used to it.

819
00:36:46,510 --> 00:36:47,510
Don't be nervous.

820
00:36:47,840 --> 00:36:49,480
Isn't it the first time for all of us?

821
00:36:49,480 --> 00:36:50,150
Yes.

822
00:36:50,230 --> 00:36:51,590
It'll be better next time.

823
00:36:51,590 --> 00:36:53,120
What are you talking about?

824
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:54,670
I'm just kidding.

825
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:56,220
You scared me to death.

826
00:36:56,960 --> 00:36:57,670
Now all three of us

827
00:36:57,670 --> 00:36:59,320
aren't nervous anymore, right?

828
00:36:59,320 --> 00:37:00,480
This is my only time.

829
00:37:00,880 --> 00:37:02,070
This is my only time too.

830
00:37:02,070 --> 00:37:03,590
Okay, I'll get married next time.

831
00:37:03,590 --> 00:37:05,150
Can you follow closer?

832
00:37:05,590 --> 00:37:07,150
We are a convoy.

833
00:37:07,510 --> 00:37:08,590
Are you waiting for someone to cut in?

834
00:37:08,590 --> 00:37:10,070
Don't be so modest.

835
00:37:11,550 --> 00:37:12,360
What?

836
00:37:13,670 --> 00:37:15,070
What are you laughing at?

837
00:37:15,070 --> 00:37:17,760
Well, I was imagining a future

838
00:37:17,760 --> 00:37:20,000
with you and Liu Zhengliang in the car.

839
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:20,960
He'll be driving,

840
00:37:20,960 --> 00:37:21,800
and you'll be in the passenger seat.

841
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:22,320
Then, Chen,

842
00:37:22,320 --> 00:37:24,110
you'll be guessing at directions.

843
00:37:24,110 --> 00:37:25,760
And then...

844
00:37:25,760 --> 00:37:26,480
I'll be guessing at directions?

845
00:37:26,480 --> 00:37:27,230
You two will argue,

846
00:37:27,230 --> 00:37:28,190
and he'll ignore you.

847
00:37:28,190 --> 00:37:28,880
Then you will

848
00:37:28,880 --> 00:37:29,710
start yelling again, Chen.

849
00:37:29,710 --> 00:37:31,960
The scene will be too funny.

850
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:32,960
Come on.

851
00:37:32,960 --> 00:37:35,020
Do you think your brother is like you?

852
00:37:35,190 --> 00:37:36,990
He's got a good laugh out of this.

853
00:37:37,110 --> 00:37:38,000
Chen, Chen.

854
00:37:38,000 --> 00:37:38,440
What?

855
00:37:38,440 --> 00:37:40,070
Isn't Chief Physician Liu coming

856
00:37:40,070 --> 00:37:40,880
today?

857
00:37:41,070 --> 00:37:42,870
Uncle Gong, I forgot to tell you.

858
00:37:43,070 --> 00:37:45,440
He can't make it
because of the surgery today.

859
00:37:45,440 --> 00:37:47,100
Life and death are important.

860
00:37:47,880 --> 00:37:49,410
Saving lives is important.

861
00:37:49,670 --> 00:37:50,730
My in-law is right.

862
00:37:52,960 --> 00:37:56,190
Please exchange rings.

863
00:37:57,480 --> 00:37:58,280
Rings.

864
00:37:59,360 --> 00:38:01,190
Wear this promise

865
00:38:01,670 --> 00:38:03,960
firmly on each other's...

866
00:38:04,550 --> 00:38:06,880
Firmly on each other's...

867
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:07,880
Let's go, come on.

868
00:38:09,800 --> 00:38:10,550
No rush.

869
00:38:11,440 --> 00:38:13,360
Everything is under control—

870
00:38:13,360 --> 00:38:14,550
Stop dawdling.

871
00:38:14,550 --> 00:38:15,800
We'll be late.

872
00:38:16,590 --> 00:38:17,400
Amy.

873
00:38:18,630 --> 00:38:20,400
You look beautiful today.

874
00:38:21,230 --> 00:38:22,150
Thank you.

875
00:38:23,510 --> 00:38:24,320
Yes.

876
00:38:24,760 --> 00:38:26,630
I remember when we got married,

877
00:38:27,760 --> 00:38:29,030
I only had 50 yuan.

878
00:38:30,800 --> 00:38:32,430
I borrowed 50 from Li

879
00:38:34,230 --> 00:38:36,000
and 50 from my dad,

880
00:38:37,030 --> 00:38:38,320
and scraped together 150

881
00:38:38,320 --> 00:38:40,000
to hold the wedding.

882
00:38:41,110 --> 00:38:44,000
Let's go reminisce in the car.

883
00:38:47,360 --> 00:38:48,360
I was thinking,

884
00:38:49,670 --> 00:38:50,550
should we

885
00:38:50,550 --> 00:38:53,000
get a pair of wedding rings?

886
00:38:54,590 --> 00:38:55,400
Okay.

887
00:38:56,440 --> 00:38:57,710
I'll steal one for you tomorrow.

888
00:38:57,710 --> 00:38:58,510
Amy.

889
00:39:00,670 --> 00:39:02,440
I'm just kidding.

890
00:39:03,320 --> 00:39:04,150
I'll buy one.

891
00:39:05,190 --> 00:39:07,320
You can get whatever kind you want.

892
00:39:07,510 --> 00:39:09,840
Then I'll have to pick carefully.

893
00:39:33,400 --> 00:39:34,920
What, are you nervous?

894
00:39:38,630 --> 00:39:39,560
Liu Zhengliang.

895
00:39:41,070 --> 00:39:43,200
You won't take revenge on me, will you?

896
00:39:43,480 --> 00:39:45,880
Maybe you should
cut back on horror movies.

897
00:39:47,510 --> 00:39:48,320
Then why didn't you

898
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:49,630
accept the gift my wife sent?

899
00:39:49,630 --> 00:39:50,960
The hospital has rules.

900
00:39:50,960 --> 00:39:53,020
We can't accept gifts from patients.

901
00:39:58,880 --> 00:40:00,410
We were too young back then.

902
00:40:01,110 --> 00:40:02,510
We didn't know anything.

903
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:08,110
I knew you remembered.

904
00:40:08,320 --> 00:40:09,650
Don't you remember too?

905
00:40:11,320 --> 00:40:12,720
But I don't care anymore.

906
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:13,800
Really?

907
00:40:13,920 --> 00:40:14,710
Really.

908
00:40:16,150 --> 00:40:16,960
Marker.

909
00:40:31,230 --> 00:40:32,470
When I'm in class,

910
00:40:34,710 --> 00:40:36,400
I often tell my students

911
00:40:38,710 --> 00:40:40,510
not to bully their classmates.

912
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:46,150
Whenever I say this,

913
00:40:47,800 --> 00:40:49,150
I always think of you.

914
00:40:58,440 --> 00:40:59,510
Today, my life

915
00:41:01,110 --> 00:41:02,320
is in your hands.

916
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:04,150
What,

917
00:41:04,960 --> 00:41:06,420
do you regret coming to me?

918
00:41:06,840 --> 00:41:08,070
I didn't mean that.

919
00:41:09,070 --> 00:41:11,510
You are lying on the operating table now.

920
00:41:13,070 --> 00:41:14,280
You are my patient,

921
00:41:14,590 --> 00:41:15,510
not my enemy.

922
00:41:18,030 --> 00:41:19,090
Did you offend him?

923
00:41:20,920 --> 00:41:21,760
It's okay.

924
00:41:22,320 --> 00:41:23,840
Chief Physician Liu doesn't hold grudges.

925
00:41:23,840 --> 00:41:24,960
Before, a patient took a knife

926
00:41:24,960 --> 00:41:26,090
and almost hurt him,

927
00:41:26,150 --> 00:41:27,750
but he still operated on him.

928
00:41:32,750 --> 00:41:34,710
It seems you really are a good doctor.

929
00:41:34,710 --> 00:41:35,440
Don't you also consider yourself

930
00:41:35,440 --> 00:41:36,550
a good teacher?

931
00:41:37,150 --> 00:41:38,810
Since we are both good people,

932
00:41:39,760 --> 00:41:41,280
can we start the surgery?

933
00:41:56,110 --> 00:41:57,960
Anesthesiologist, wake the patient.

934
00:41:57,960 --> 00:41:59,420
Yes, Chief Physician Liu.

935
00:42:02,150 --> 00:42:02,960
Wang Bao.

936
00:42:05,280 --> 00:42:06,680
Can you hear me, Wang Bao?

937
00:42:08,480 --> 00:42:09,280
Wang Bao?

938
00:42:14,280 --> 00:42:16,480
Do you remember what you do for a living?

939
00:42:18,280 --> 00:42:19,070
Wang Bao?

940
00:42:22,710 --> 00:42:24,280
Wang Bao, can you hear me?

941
00:42:25,150 --> 00:42:27,010
Speak if you can hear me, Wang Bao.

942
00:42:27,320 --> 00:42:29,070
Anesthesiologist, what's going on?

943
00:42:29,070 --> 00:42:30,510
Is the dosage too high?

944
00:42:30,710 --> 00:42:32,150
The patient is not conscious.

945
00:42:32,150 --> 00:42:33,760
There shouldn't be any problem,
Chief Physician Liu.

946
00:42:33,760 --> 00:42:35,690
Maybe the drug metabolism is slow.

947
00:42:36,150 --> 00:42:38,440
Or let's wait a bit longer.

948
00:42:38,710 --> 00:42:41,110
Wang Bao, can you hear me?

949
00:42:45,960 --> 00:42:47,150
I can hear you.

950
00:42:48,280 --> 00:42:50,110
Good, as long as you can hear me.

951
00:42:54,920 --> 00:42:55,850
Liu Zhengliang.

952
00:43:00,150 --> 00:43:01,030
I'm sorry.

953
00:43:05,590 --> 00:43:06,480
It's okay.

954
00:43:07,480 --> 00:43:08,070
Yang Ran,

955
00:43:08,070 --> 00:43:09,630
prepare for the language function test.

956
00:43:09,630 --> 00:43:10,230
Okay.

957
00:43:10,360 --> 00:43:11,360
Pass the cortical stimulator.

958
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:11,800
Okay.
